    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file 'invoke_platform_model.py' that invokes a provider-managed model, I need to select a concrete external provider and use its specific SDK or API. For this task, I will use Amazon Bedrock, which is a suitable choice for invoking managed models. I will import the necessary SDK, set up the client, and include a concrete model identifier to make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
